        <briefdescription>
<para>splits the near-planar region bounded by <computeroutput>loops</computeroutput> in monotone parts, without triangulating them this is the sweep-line triangulation stopped right after monotonation </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
