<parametername>loops</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>one closed EdgeLoop of at least 3 edges per boundary of one region, bounding holes of <computeroutput>mesh</computeroutput> as trackRightBoundaryLoop returns them; which way round a loop runs does not matter </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>normal</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>the orientation the region is monotone around, see <ref refid="classMR_1_1PlanarTriangulation_1aa43721ee35ac47b736aab3533b4bf7a0" kindref="member">triangulateDisjointContours</ref> </para>
</parameterdescription>
